  title: Subhas Chandra Bose
  text: Subhas Chandra Bose, twice president of the Congress, formed the Forward Bloc, escaped from house arrest in 1941, and led the Indian National Army and the Provisional Government of Free India. He is reported to have died after a plane crash in Taiwan in August 1945.
